      "name": "dsh-loomy-connect",
      "title": {
        "en": "Loomy Connect",
        "zh": "Loomy 模型接入"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Use the models included with the Loomy desktop app in DSH with no configuration. Shows a composer credit pill and a model-rate popover, with a settings card for credits and the model list.",
        "zh": "把 Loomy 桌面 App 包含的模型直接接入 DSH，开箱即用。输入框显示 Loomy 积分胶囊与模型倍率弹层，设置卡片可查看积分与模型清单。"
      },
      "icon": "icons/loomy-connect.svg",
      "author": "hanwu-git",
