    {
      "name": "dsh-memory-nodes",
      "title": {
        "en": "Memory nodes",
        "zh": "记忆节点"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Platform and project level long-term memory. Injects two compiled memory nodes into every session, gives the model memory write/read tools, and re-compiles raw notes into structured memory on demand from the plugin details page.",
        "zh": "平台级与项目级长期记忆。向每个会话注入两个编译后的记忆节点，提供模型记忆读写工具，并可在插件详情页一键将原始记录二次编译为结构化记忆。"
      },
      "icon": "icons/memory-nodes.svg",
      "author": "hanwu-git",
      "repository": {
