    {
      "name": "@local/credit-hud",
      "title": {
        "en": "Credit HUD",
        "zh": "积分浮窗"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A sidebar-footer entry that opens a floating panel listing the current credit balance of every connected platform: Trae (CN), WorkBuddy, Qoder (CN), Qoder (Global) and Loomy; Doubao Work has no readable balance route yet and shows a placeholder row. Every number is read from the owning plugin's own read-only route; nothing is written.",
        "zh": "左下角一个「积分」入口，点开浮窗汇总各已接入平台的当前积分余额：Trae 国内、WorkBuddy、Qoder 国内、Qoder 国际、Loomy；豆包工作暂无可读余额接口，占位显示。数据全部来自各插件自身的只读路由，不写任何配置。"
      },
      "icon": "icons/credit-hud.svg",
